    <h2>Level 107 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Swipe left (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe left on the red-clad girl's face. Drag the bracelet from the girl in red onto the boy’s hand. Tap to open the handbag.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the cosmetics (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the cosmetics from the bag to the girl on the right. Swipe right on the boy's face. Swipe left on the boy’s shirt.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Swipe up (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe up on the boy’s pants. Drag the scarf from the blue-dressed girl’s pants onto the boy’s arm. Tap the hands held by the two people on the right.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–11</span>
      <strong>Tap the boy's hand making a heart gesture (then 1 more)</strong>
      <p>Tap the boy's hand making a heart gesture. Tap the face of the girl on the right.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 107 shows “Daring Acrobatics”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Help the man dodge flying knives.”, this is that scene, 16 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Drag the book on the floor to the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the mask to the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the paintbrush to the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the spinning wheel to the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the funhouse mirror to the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the ceiling fan to the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the hammer to the window.</li>
        <li>Swipe right on the projector in the top left.</li>
        <li>Drag the key on the man to the fancy box.</li>
        <li>Drag the potion to the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the clown’s sheath to the knife in his hand.</li>
        <li>Drag the mechanism base on the board to the blade lever.</li>
        <li>Swipe down the lever.</li>
        <li>Swipe down the rope above the man.</li>
        <li>Drag the throwing knife from the dummy’s head to the pumpkin.</li>
        <li>Drag the pumpkin head to the man.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 107?</summary><p>In order: 1) Swipe left on the red-clad girl's face; 2) Drag the bracelet from the girl in red onto the boy’s hand; 3) Tap to open the handbag; 4) Drag the cosmetics from the bag to the girl on the right; 5) Swipe right on the boy's face; 6) Swipe left on the boy’s shirt; 7) Swipe up on the boy’s pants; 8) Drag the scarf from the blue-dressed girl’s pants onto the boy’s arm; 9) Tap the hands held by the two people on the right; 10) Tap the boy's hand making a heart gesture; 11) Tap the face of the girl on the right</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 107?</summary><p>Level 107 mixes gestures: 3 drags, 4 taps, 4 swipes. Only the tap steps answer a single tap; the rest are drags or swipes. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object onto the person or thing it belongs to.</p></details>
